        "text_HKf6W8": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Step One: Choose your garments from our website </strong></p><p>Hi-Vis  Vests for Community projects or Specialised Work Teams</p><ul><li>Caps & Beanies </li><li>Hi Vis Gear </li><li>Plain AS Colours Tee’s and Hoody’s </li><li>Overalls</li><li>Other Specialist items  - please contact us for enquiries.</li></ul><p><strong>Step Two: Heat Transfer or Embroidery?</strong></p><p>Choose heat transfer for complex, colorful designs, high-volume orders, and a modern, flexible finish, as it offers cost-efficiency, a faster application process, and is ideal for athletic wear. </p><p>Opt for embroidery for a premium, textured, and durable 3D look, perfect for smaller orders, simpler logos, and sturdy fabrics like fleece or denim where longevity matching the garment is desired. </p><p><strong>Step Three : Fill in the form above or email us with artwork and garment choices - </strong><a href=\"/pages/contact-us\" title=\"Contact Us\"><strong>Sales@faanz.co.nz</strong></a></p><p><strong>We require supplied artwork/files for logos and images to ensure your workwear is customised to your specifications.</strong> For text work, such as staff names, no artwork/files are needed. We always send a proof for your approval before starting any work. </p><p></p><p></p><p></p>",
